<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 24pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  p {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .contact-info p {
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <header style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Financial Assistance</h2>
    <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">
      Financial Assistance <span>1</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div style="max-width: 700px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 25px;">FINANCIAL ASSISTANCE</h1>

    <p>
      Financing the cost of a high quality education like the one you will
      receive at {{ institution_name }} requires commitment, sacrifice, and careful planning.
      {{ institution_name }} believes that the first responsibility for funding the cost of a
      Wabash education lies with students and their parents. Please contact
      the Wabash College Financial Aid Office if you have questions about
      your financial aid package, or how to finance your portion of educational
      expenses. You may call, email, or write our office with any questions you
      may have.
    </p>

    <div class="contact-info" style="margin-top: 30px;">
      <p>Wabash Financial Aid Office Phone Number: (800) 718-9746</p>
      <p>Wabash Financial Aid Office Fax Number: (765) 361-6166</p>
      <p>Wabash Financial Aid Office Email Address: <span data-field="financial_aid_email">{{ financial_aid_email }}</span></p>
      <p>Wabash Financial Aid Website: <span data-field="financial_aid_website">{{ financial_aid_website }}</span></p>
      <p>Wabash Financial Aid Office Mailing Address: Wabash Financial Aid Office, PO Box 352, Crawfordsville, IN {{ zip_code }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>